        "3 / 1",
        "Fixed-pattern bounded noise; repeats are correlated."
      ],
      [
        "Probe contact",
        "4 / 2",
        "Gentle adds 1 wear; firm adds 2. Reading refers to the changed surface."
      ],
      [
